Not all wands can be used to engrave - though you can use engraving to
identify some wands... by reading the descriptions (if any) or
modifications in existing engraving. ;)

And for those wands that can engrave something, not all of them are
permanent.

Ask again if you want spoilers about permanent engraving and wand
identification by engraving. :)



